      "agent_response": "Done — I’ve saved that memory.\n\nSummary stored:\n- You made travel plans for a vacation to Italy next month; you’re excited to explore cities, taste authentic Italian cuisine, and immerse yourself in the culture.\n\nExisting related memories I also have:\n- You joined a virtual cooking competition with Olivia (your lemon tart won first place).\n- You attended a weekend pasta workshop at Chef Mia’s Culinary Studio with a friend.\n\nWould you like to add specifics (travel dates, cities, flight/hotel info, travel companion), set reminders (packing, check-in, itinerary), or draft a message to friends/family about the trip?",
