      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: Please remember that I attended a local event last Friday with my friend Sarah. We had a great time exploring the art and music festival in the park, and we even bought handmade jewelry from a local artist.",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ve saved that memory.\n\nSummary stored:\n- You attended a local art & music festival last Friday with your friend Sarah; you had a great time and bought handmade jewelry from a local artist.\n\nWould you like to add details (artist name, exact date/location, photos), set a reminder (e.g., jewelry care or follow-up with the artist), or draft a message to Sarah or the artist?",
