      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: Please remember that I recently attended a cooking class at Gourmet Delights Cooking School with my cousin Emma. We learned how to make French pastries like croissants and macarons. The instructor, Chef Pierre, shared some fantastic baking tips with us that I can't wait to try at home.",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ve saved that memory.\n\nSummary stored:\n- You attended a cooking class at Gourmet Delights Cooking School with your cousin Emma; you learned to make croissants and macarons, and Chef Pierre shared baking tips you want to try.\n\nYour current related memories:\n1) Weekend cooking workshop at Chef Mia's Culinary Studio with a friend (Italian pasta)\n2) Virtual cooking competition last weekend with Olivia (won first place with a lemon tart)\n3) Local art & music festival last Friday with Sarah (bought handmade jewelry)\n4) Travel plans for an upcoming vacation to Italy\n5) Cooking class at Gourmet Delights with cousin Emma (French pastries; Chef Pierre)\n\nWould you like to:\n- Add details (date, location, specific tips from Chef Pierre)?\n- Set a reminder (practice baking, follow up with Chef Pierre, or share recipes)?\n- Draft/send a message to Emma or Chef Pierre?",
