      "expected_behavior": "Agent should acknowledge and remember: Please remember that I tried a new restaurant called Spice Bazaar last night with my colleague David. The Middle Eastern dishes were outstanding, especially the lamb kebabs and baklava for dessert. We're already planning to go back next week to try more dishes.",
      "agent_response": "Got it — I’ve saved that memory.\n\nSummary stored:\n- You tried a new restaurant, Spice Bazaar, last night with your colleague David; you loved the lamb kebabs and baklava and you're planning to go back next week.\n\nYour updated related memories:\n1) Cooking class at Gourmet Delights (made croissants & macarons with cousin Emma; Chef Pierre’s tips)  \n2) Weekend cooking workshop at Chef Mia's (Italian pasta with a friend)  \n3) Virtual cooking competition with Olivia (won first place — lemon tart)  \n4) Local art & music festival with Sarah (bought handmade jewelry)  \n5) Travel plans for upcoming vacation to Italy  \n6) Dinner at Spice Bazaar with colleague David (lamb kebabs, baklava; planning a return visit)\n\nWould you like to add details (date/time, reservation info), set a reminder for the return visit, or draft a message to David or the restaurant?",
