          "session_id": "bench_027bcfe5",
          "event_type": "user_input",
          "payload": {
            "text": "I attended a weekend cooking workshop at Chef Mia's Culinary Studio with my friend Lisa. We learned to make traditional Italian pasta from scratch, including spaghetti alla carbonara and fettuccine Alfredo. The hands-on experience was fantastic, and now I can't wait to try these recipes at home."
