          "event_type": "agent_response",
          "payload": {
            "text": "Got it — I see the memory: you joined a virtual cooking competition with Olivia (your lemon tart won) and you also attended a weekend pasta workshop with Lisa at Chef Mia's Culinary Studio.\n\nWhat would you like me to do with this? Options:\n- Save this as a memory (so I can recall it later)\n- Send or draft a thank-you / celebration email to Olivia (I can include the winning details)\n- Draft an email sharing the win and recipes with friends/family\n- Do nothing / just acknowledge\n\nIf you want an email to Olivia, here’s a ready-to-send suggestion (I can send it or save as a draft):\n\nSubject: Thanks for the win, Olivia!\nBody:\nHi Olivia —  \nStill buzzing from last weekend’s competition! Our lemon tart won first place — the judges loved the balance of flavors and that perfect pastry crust we made together. I had so much fun cooking with you. Want to celebrate this weekend?  \n\n— [Your name]\n\nTell me which option you want and, if sending an email, whether to send now or save as a draft and any edits or recipient address to use."
